{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underwater Duo</strong> is a 1\u20132 player cooperative survival game. You and a friend will control a turtle and a jellyfish, using their unique abilities to fend off wave after wave of underwater creatures and become legends of the deep!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two-player cooperative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The turtle and jellyfish have completely different controls and skill roles. Only by working together can they survive the relentless waves of deep-sea creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/2f1118934442542e7c012d63491f6367.poster.avif?t=1773505005\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/2f1118934442542e7c012d63491f6367.webm?t=1773505005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/2f1118934442542e7c012d63491f6367.mp4?t=1773505005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fusion Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When certain conditions are met, the turtle and jellyfish can fuse, combining their strengths, compensating for each other\u2019s weaknesses, and unleashing even greater power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/59df6814d1b9540b13e69c6bdade395c.poster.avif?t=1773505005\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/59df6814d1b9540b13e69c6bdade395c.webm?t=1773505005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/59df6814d1b9540b13e69c6bdade395c.mp4?t=1773505005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Constantly Growing Stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the surging waves of the deep sea, you must continuously select, upgrade, and combine skills to create a unique, ultimate combination capable of facing increasingly fierce enemies and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/cdd64b4fd697c78e2a58ec008416cdef.poster.avif?t=1773505005\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/cdd64b4fd697c78e2a58ec008416cdef.webm?t=1773505005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/cdd64b4fd697c78e2a58ec008416cdef.mp4?t=1773505005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend and dive into thrilling underwater battles in the deep sea. Coordinate, complement each other\u2019s weaknesses, and write your own legendary story beneath the waves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/ea336ca243a0699b7ed9b7ca98e7ac68.poster.avif?t=1773505005\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/ea336ca243a0699b7ed9b7ca98e7ac68.webm?t=1773505005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/ea336ca243a0699b7ed9b7ca98e7ac68.mp4?t=1773505005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736310?t=1773505005","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/8ca8f6c2385e4ab105afd659207ff8abe8680124/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773505005","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/7699dedc47d8cb251c4388822b904d5519aa3c15/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773505005","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/7699dedc47d8cb251c4388822b904d5519aa3c15/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773505005","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underwater Duo</strong> is a 1\u20132 player cooperative survival game. You and a friend will control a turtle and a jellyfish, using their unique abilities to fend off wave after wave of underwater creatures and become legends of the deep!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two-player cooperative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The turtle and jellyfish have completely different controls and skill roles. Only by working together can they survive the relentless waves of deep-sea creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/2f1118934442542e7c012d63491f6367.poster.avif?t=1773505005\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/2f1118934442542e7c012d63491f6367.webm?t=1773505005\" t